  "scientific_consequence": "For integer face loads x, RF1 cannot identify min_x ||F-Ax||\u00b2/2 with q^T L+ q/2. That is the real-domain minimum. Time averaging can reproduce its mean field without reproducing its energy. A face-step refinement is an explicit different domain.",
